  <History Date="26-11-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (hopeless documentation.  Starry letter and number not detailed fully and don't makes sense.  232 channel mode not detailed fully and doesn't make sense.  assumed is 32x CWWW rather than 16.  no pixel layout.  made best guess)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="29-11-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="4" />
